        rdfs:comment                   "Panel of silk tapestry (kesi), China, Qing dynasty, 19th century"@en , "Panel of silk tapestry (kesi), woven in coloured silks and gold thread on a pale greying ground; the details of the designs have been executed with the brush. Pattern of two phoenixes surrounded by sprays of flowers, including peonies, magnolia and asters."@en ;
